script: Array.prototype.lastIndexOf.call(new Proxy({}, {get: function (t, k) { return k === "length" ? 9007199254740991 : 0; }, has: function () { return true; }}), 0, $f64(0x00000000, 0x00000000))
note: the script shows ToIntegerOrInfinity(x) as the index lastIndexOf starts from on an array-like of length 2^53 - 1 that has every index: min(n, 2^53 - 2) for n >= 0, 2^53 - 1 + n for n < 0, and -1 for -Infinity or below -(2^53 - 1)
